
# Code and documentation: LF in the repository and on every checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Frozen evidence, dataset manifests and figures are stored byte-for-byte:
# the SHA-256 digests quoted in the group summaries and in the supplement
# are digests of these exact bytes (several records were written on Windows
# with CRLF line endings), so no end-of-line conversion may touch them.
results/** -text
dataset/** -text
figures/** -text
evidence/** -text
